+.. rst:directive:: .. py:type:: name
+
+   Describes a type alias in a module or class. The alias expression is
+   optional and can be given with the ``canonical`` option. Type names in the
+   expression are parsed as Python cross-references.
+
+   .. rubric:: options
+
+   .. rst:directive:option:: canonical: type expression
+      :type: text
+
+      Show the expression assigned to the alias. The expression is parsed using
+      the Python annotation parser and its value is also registered as an alias
+      for cross-references.
+
+   The directive accepts description content, but the alias does not establish
+   a nested namespace.
+
